687
01:56:51.202 --> 01:56:56.202
At the end of this service, and I want, I have just asked that the eyes be closed.

688
01:56:56.202 --> 01:56:58.202
Sorry that I ask it so much.

689
01:56:58.202 --> 01:57:04.202
But I always want to give people the opportunity to come to King Jesus at the end of this service.

690
01:57:05.202 --> 01:57:12.202
You know, communion is really for those who acknowledge Jesus as Lord.

691
01:57:12.202 --> 01:57:15.202
You do it together to celebrate Him.

692
01:57:15.202 --> 01:57:18.202
So communion is something for the believers.

693
01:57:18.202 --> 01:57:23.202
But it may also be that you have been invited here by a friend or family member.

694
01:57:23.202 --> 01:57:26.202
And then you are here and you do not know Jesus very well yet.

695
01:57:26.202 --> 01:57:30.202
But you think to yourself, ah indeed I do not know.

696
01:57:31.202 --> 01:57:36.202
My answer is what I just wanted to say about that unleavened bread and the haste we make.

697
01:57:36.202 --> 01:57:39.202
Make a choice for King Jesus.

698
01:57:40.202 --> 01:57:45.202
And you know we always have a prayer here and I want to ask Nanny if she can put the prayer on the screen.

699
01:57:46.202 --> 01:57:49.202
We have written out a prayer. It is a simple prayer.

700
01:57:49.202 --> 01:57:53.202
But it is just a prayer that I want to read together and pray together as a church.

701
01:57:53.202 --> 01:57:57.202
So that you can have the chance to come to King Jesus.

702
01:57:57.202 --> 01:58:00.202
For it is indeed the most important choice you can make.

703
01:58:00.202 --> 01:58:05.202
Whatever you are going to do in your life. Coming to Jesus is the best choice.

704
01:58:05.202 --> 01:58:08.202
And it starts with a simple prayer.

705
01:58:08.202 --> 01:58:13.202
You don't have to have everything perfect in your life before you come to Jesus.

706
01:58:13.202 --> 01:58:16.202
You must come to Jesus as you are.

707
01:58:16.202 --> 01:58:20.202
To let the perfection of the Lord work itself out in your life.

708
01:58:20.202 --> 01:58:22.202
Shall we read it together?

709
01:58:22.202 --> 01:58:24.202
Thank you, Jesus.

710
01:58:24.202 --> 01:58:27.202
I believe that you are the Son of God.

711
01:58:27.202 --> 01:58:31.202
I believe that you died on the cross for my sin.

712
01:58:31.202 --> 01:58:34.202
Forgive me all my mistakes.

713
01:58:34.202 --> 01:58:36.202
I invite you into my life, Jesus.

714
01:58:36.202 --> 01:58:39.202
Give me a new start.

715
01:58:39.202 --> 01:58:41.202
Help me to live for you.

716
01:58:41.202 --> 01:58:45.202
From today on, I am a child of God. Amen.

717
01:58:45.202 --> 01:58:48.202
Amen and amen. Hallelujah.

718
01:58:49.202 --> 01:58:51.202
Thank you.

719
01:58:51.202 --> 01:58:53.202
Thank you, guys.

720
01:58:53.202 --> 01:58:57.202
Tomorrow there is prayer at half past seven and I want to invite you to be there.

721
01:58:57.202 --> 01:59:03.202
Tomorrow there is no prayer at half past seven and I do not want to invite you to be there.

722
01:59:03.202 --> 01:59:06.202
Tomorrow there is no prayer.

723
01:59:06.202 --> 01:59:10.202
In the name of Jesus, I thank you.

724
01:59:10.202 --> 01:59:14.202
That we could all be here in the presence of God.

725
01:59:14.202 --> 01:59:16.202
And I send us out with the Holy Spirit.

726
01:59:16.202 --> 01:59:20.202
That we may enter our week in the authority of King Jesus.

727
01:59:20.202 --> 01:59:23.202
Amen. Amen. Until next week.
